      "description": "Yesterday, Kathmandu sky was really furious. Storm roared in the evening claiming at least  two deaths in the valley. A week back at least 17 people were killed in Terai region of Nepal from similar storm. Deaths like this in Nepal was a rare news in past years. Is the infamous global warming causing these all ?\nI took this shot from my terrace after the storm went by followed by a downpour.\nThe Cynic Project - After the Storm\nView On Black\n\nExplored! :)",
